SUMMARY:Jazz Art Writers South Festival Youth Exhibit 2026
LOCATION:Monte L. Moorer/Spring Hill Branch Library\, 4 S McGregor Ave\, Mo
 bile\, AL 36608
DESCRIPTION:Nov 1 to Dec 15 · all day during branch hours\, closed Sundays
 \n\nMore than fifty paintings by artists ages 8 to 18 who attend local pub
 lic schools interpret jazz music at the Monte L. Moorer/Spring Hill Branch
  Library. The JAWS Festival put the exhibit together with the Mobile Arts 
 Council and the Amp Up Arts Program\, and it hangs from November 1 through
  December 15 during branch hours\, which are Monday to Saturday.\n\nPrice:
  No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-jaz
 z-art-writers-south-festival-youth-exhibi-0801.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-jazz-art-writers-south-festival-
 youth-exhibi-0801.html
CATEGORIES:Arts and culture
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
