DESCRIPTION:Thursdays · 3:00 PM to 4:30 PM\n\nThe museum runs a free Thurs
 day afternoon art session most weeks\, working through materials and techn
 iques borrowed from artists on view. November sessions are Fall Landscapes
  on November 5 and Handle with Care Felt Garden on November 12. The sessio
 n does not run on Family Art Days or city holidays\, so check with the mus
 eum first.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/
 ev-mobile-museum-make-take-art.html
