DESCRIPTION:Monday 1/11 · 6:00 PM to 8:00 PM\n\nCoastal Makers hosts a fra
 ctal burning class led by Evan. Participants burn Lichtenberg patterns int
 o wood and finish a Mardi Gras bead strand with sparkly gems\, with tips f
 rom the instructor. The price is $50 per person\, all supplies are include
 d and no experience is needed. Recommended for ages 16 and up\, and minors
  need a registered adult.\n\nPrice: from $50\n\nDetails: https://coastalev
 entures.com/events/ev-coastalmakers-fractal-0111.html
