 an Theatre is Pensacola Little Theatre's 24 hour theatre\, where actors au
 dition Friday night\, writers draft new short plays overnight\, and the ca
 st rehearses the next day before the curtain rises. The run is a collectio
 n of favorite pieces plus some new works\, directed by Justin Gaylard and 
 others in Studio 400. It runs February 12 to 21.\n\nPrice: No published pr
 ice\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-plt-short-attention
