DESCRIPTION:Monday 2/15 · 9:00 AM\n\nFirst City Art Center runs a one day 
 art camp on the Presidents' Day school holiday. Each camp has a full art l
 esson and a hands on project led by a teacher\, with outdoor breaks when t
 he weather allows. Half day camps take ages 5 to 12 and full day camps tak
 e ages 6 to 12. Registration closes the Friday before camp.\n\nPrice: from
  $50\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-fcac-youth-art-cam
 p-presidents-0215.html
